==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|automne}}, {{m|fro|autompne}}, probably later borrowed from {{bor|fr|la|autumnus}}. The rural and popular term for autumn was {{m|fr|[[après]] [[août]]||after August}}. 

Apres is a derivative of the Hieroglyphic apis; as in the apis bull a major deity of in the Egyptian Pantheon. Meaning the previous of the change. The fixed points in the earths orbit around the sun Sept 22, going into October 31 next fixed point in the earths orbit around the sun. 

